00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:33.086 size:81% position:41%
and it's -- I've had
a real blast doing it.

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:37.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
This -- this character
has been -- it's been grea

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:41.194
because I've never really done
a show where it's so immediate

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:44.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I got a script
and I had just the colorin

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.832 line:92%
