00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so you're always, like
on the edge,

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:59.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, everything's
boiling underneath,

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:02.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then when you see the
script, you go, "Okay. Okay.

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:05.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's let loose on this way,
on this direction,

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's been -- it's been -
it's been fun.

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:11.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I must say,
you're shooting during COVID -

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:15.528 size:84% position:42%
I'm thrilled to be part
of a of a production.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are going --
coming to work.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:22.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kudos to the production.
